#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Fake `gh` for the github-oma tests.

Emulates exactly the calls bin/github-oma makes, driven by FAKE_GH_MODE:

    ok          (default) normal answers
    no-auth     the login call fails the way an unauthenticated gh does
    auth-error  GraphQL fails with gh's auth-login hint
    flaky       the first GraphQL call answers a 502, later ones succeed
    broken      GraphQL answers something that is not JSON, always
    hang        GraphQL sleeps past the helper's timeout

Every invocation appends its argv to FAKE_GH_LOG, so the tests can prove how
many processes a refresh costs and what the query asked for.
"""

